{"id":"5b6fbefd-d05a-4c25-8b00-cb60419d47d6","title":"Offsets 3","slug":"offsets-3","collectionSlug":"offsets","collectionName":"Offsets","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A dynamic shader effect dominated by flowing purple gradients transitioning from deep black to vibrant violet and magenta hues. The composition features a FlowingGradient base layer that creates smooth, organic color transitions using a color palette spanning from pure black (#000000) through purple (#6b17e6) to bright violet (#9d35ff). The gradient flows at moderate speed (3.5) creating a sense of continuous motion. Overlaid on this base is a GridDistortion effect with a 6x6 grid pattern that creates visible rectangular blocks and geometric distortion, particularly noticeable in the center and edges where darker rectangular shapes emerge against the brighter purple background. The distortion has a decay value of 8.3, creating soft edges on the geometric shapes. A BarShift component with 6 vertical bars adds subtle horizontal striations at 15% intensity. The entire composition is unified with a BlueNoise overlay at 25% opacity using an overlay blend mode, which adds fine grain texture and subtle dithering throughout, creating a slightly grainy, atmospheric quality. The edges fade to transparency, and the overall effect creates a moody, abstract digital landscape with depth created by the interplay of dark and bright purple tones. The spatial arrangement shows darker regions concentrated in the upper-left, center, and right edges, while brighter violet dominates the center and upper-right areas.","colors":["#6b17e6","#9d35ff","#684dff","#000000"],"labels":["gradient","geometric","textured","dark"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/5b6fbefd-d05a-4c25-8b00-cb60419d47d6.jpg","toneMapping":"neutral","components":[{"type":"FlowingGradient","id":"idmsq3j7yazb9j5e4jd","_key":"key_msq3j7yazb9j5e4jd","props":{"seed":0,"speed":3.5,"colorA":"#000000","colorB":"#6b17e6","colorC":"#684dff","colo